  user_2,[00:00] Hi Vedant, this is Karan from Safe Step Insurance, how are you doing today?
  user_1,[00:05] Uh, hey Karan... I'm good, thanks. Yeah, I can hear you.
  user_2,[00:10] Great. Just wanted to quickly verify a few details—can you confirm your date of birth, please?
  user_1,[00:15] Sure... it's 12/04/1990.
  user_2,[00:20] Thanks. And the vehicle registration number you have on file is MH12AB1234, right?
  user_1,[00:24] Yeah, that's correct.
  user_2,[00:30] Okay, so I see your auto policy (Policy #AU-4589) is set to expire on 30/09/2026. That's... [sighs] just a couple of days away.
  user_1,[00:38] Oh, really? I didn't realize it was that close.
  user_2,[00:42] No worries. We can either let it lapse—then it’ll show as 'Expired' in the system—or we can start a renewal right now. What would you prefer?
  user_1,[00:50] Hmm... I think I'd like to keep it active. Can we renew it today?